{"id":"n12iloa27po2ed40dmz1dmcg1","title":"Nature评论：亚马逊雨林树木落叶模式的新发现","originalTitle":"A new view of Amazonian leaf seasonality","summary":"Nature评论文章揭示亚马逊雨林树木落叶期比预期更长，气候因素起主导作用。该研究对比了热带与温带落叶模式差异，发现亚马逊雨林树木在落叶后仍保持较长时间的无叶状态，且年降雨量等气候条件比土壤和光照更重要。这一发现为理解热带森林碳循环和生态适应机制提供了新视角。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Nature"},"links":{"original":"https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03490-5"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T17:54:37.991Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T17:54:37.991Z","category":"life-science","tags":["论文发表","Nature"],"score":53,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"9a309553-624b-4240-a2ef-c997d6863075","title":"Nature揭示亚马逊雨林落叶期延长及气候主导机制"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"Gerbrand Koren","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"9a309553-624b-4240-a2ef-c997d6863075","title":"Nature揭示亚马逊雨林落叶期延长及气候主导机制"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nature","name":"Nature"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fDgHfRytb0rI","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}